    {
      "sentence_id": 4,
      "text": "1 By this judgment I will dispose of appeal u/sec.374 Cr.PC. filed on behalf of convict Rajesh Batra against the judgment dated 24.02.2014 and order on sentence dated 06.03.2014 passed by Sh.\nGaurav Rao, Ld. ACMM-II, Patiala House Court, New Delhi.",
